{"3140720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ritual Party", "steam_appid": 3140720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Summon Cthulhu with your friends!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ritual Party is a co-op party game</strong> in which you and your friends get to conduct rituals to   <br>summon all manner of cosmic horrors from the Cthulhu mythos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140720/extras/09f97ba84b70752408bfe7e3ecefa6c3.poster.avif?t=1784329153\" width=472 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140720/extras/09f97ba84b70752408bfe7e3ecefa6c3.webm?t=1784329153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140720/extras/09f97ba84b70752408bfe7e3ecefa6c3.mp4?t=1784329153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140720/extras/f14f9010e7756b5688d403b676f1b30f.avif?t=1784329153\" width=1084 height=1356 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140720/extras/4e6f21323a174e9199eb0d15db15f01e.poster.avif?t=1784329153\" width=472 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140720/extras/4e6f21323a174e9199eb0d15db15f01e.webm?t=1784329153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140720/extras/4e6f21323a174e9199eb0d15db15f01e.mp4?t=1784329153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A lot can go wrong.</strong> Someone might slip on some blood, <br>get swept away by a tentacle monster or fall into icy waters.<br>Spirits from beyond can also cause mayhem!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All this and more must be managed while the police and flesh-freezing winds close in on the ritual sites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140720/extras/34355cff7ef84dd13cf9fccd26d342ca.poster.avif?t=1784329153\" width=472 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140720/extras/34355cff7ef84dd13cf9fccd26d342ca.webm?t=1784329153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140720/extras/34355cff7ef84dd13cf9fccd26d342ca.mp4?t=1784329153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You'll get to explore a multitude of eerie</strong>, otherworldly locations inspired by   <br>Lovecraft’s Cthulhu Mythos, where cosmic dread and ancient mysteries challenge your perception of reality.   </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Summon Cthulhu with your friends!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ritual Party is a co-op party game</strong> in which you and your friends get to conduct rituals to   <br>summon all manner of cosmic horrors from the Cthulhu mythos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140720/extras/09f97ba84b70752408bfe7e3ecefa6c3.poster.avif?t=1784329153\" width=472 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140720/extras/09f97ba84b70752408bfe7e3ecefa6c3.webm?t=1784329153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140720/extras/09f97ba84b70752408bfe7e3ecefa6c3.mp4?t=1784329153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140720/extras/f14f9010e7756b5688d403b676f1b30f.avif?t=1784329153\" width=1084 height=1356 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140720/extras/4e6f21323a174e9199eb0d15db15f01e.poster.avif?t=1784329153\" width=472 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140720/extras/4e6f21323a174e9199eb0d15db15f01e.webm?t=1784329153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140720/extras/4e6f21323a174e9199eb0d15db15f01e.mp4?t=1784329153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A lot can go wrong.</strong> Someone might slip on some blood, <br>get swept away by a tentacle monster or fall into icy waters.<br>Spirits from beyond can also cause mayhem!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All this and more must be managed while the police and flesh-freezing winds close in on the ritual sites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140720/extras/34355cff7ef84dd13cf9fccd26d342ca.poster.avif?t=1784329153\" width=472 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140720/extras/34355cff7ef84dd13cf9fccd26d342ca.webm?t=1784329153\" t